## 📌 Important Commands

### Simulation Commands

|                Command              |           Purpose            |
|-------------------------------------|------------------------------|
| `./simu_icarus.sh cpu_top`          | Run basic simulation         |
| `./simu_icarus.sh cpu_top +test=N`  | Run test case N              |
| `./simu_icarus.sh cpu_top +trace`   | Enable execution trace       |
| `./simu_icarus.sh cpu_top +trace_w` | Enable detailed writes trace |
| `./simu.sh cpu_top`                 | Run with Xcelium simulator   |

### Synthesis Commands

|           Command          |          Purpose             |
|----------------------------|------------------------------|
| `./run_synth.sh cpu_top`   | Synthesis with Yosys         |
| `genus -f synth_genus.tcl` | Synthesis with Cadence Genus |

### Waveform Viewing

|          Command      |          Purpose          |
|-----------------------|---------------------------|
| `gtkwave cpu_top.vcd` | View VCD waveforms        |
| `gtkwave &`           | Launch GTKWave standalone |

### Version Control

|       Command       |         Purpose         |
|---------------------|-------------------------|
| `git status`        | Check repository status |
| `git log --oneline` | View commit history     |
| `git diff`          | View file changes       |

