## 📦 Dependencies

### Required Tools

|        Tool        | Version |      Purpose      |         Install            |
|--------------------|---------|-------------------|----------------------------|
| **Icarus Verilog** | 10.0+   | Verilog simulator | `apt-get install iverilog` |
| **GTKWave**        | 3.3+    | Waveform viewer   | `apt-get install gtkwave`  |
| **Yosys**          | Latest  | Logic synthesis   | `apt-get install yosys`    |

### Optional Tools

|          Tool         |           Purpose              |
|-----------------------|--------------------------------|
| **Xcelium** (Cadence) | Enterprise-grade simulator     |
| **Genus** (Cadence)   | Commercial synthesis tool      |
| **SKY130 PDK**        | Open-source process design kit |

### SystemVerilog Features

- Testbenches use SystemVerilog (`*.sv`) for advanced verification features
- Module instantiation and parameterization
- Task-based verification framework
- Automatic checking and reporting

